WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Hello?

00:13.000 --> 00:15.000
Hello?

00:15.000 --> 00:18.000
Hello?

00:27.000 --> 00:31.000
Defiance in the eyes, like his father.

00:32.000 --> 00:34.000
Why you have a blanket on your face?

00:34.000 --> 00:46.000
Come here, Neil.

00:47.000 --> 00:49.000
Put your right hand in the box.

00:49.000 --> 00:52.000
What's in the box?

00:52.000 --> 01:04.000
Pain.

01:04.000 --> 01:07.000
Emma, no one to put hand in box.

01:07.000 --> 01:10.000
Your mother bade you obey me.

01:10.000 --> 01:13.000
Emma's mama.

01:13.000 --> 01:23.000
I hold at your neck the gom java.

01:23.000 --> 01:27.000
Poisoned needle, instant death.

01:27.000 --> 01:29.000
The test is simple.

01:29.000 --> 01:33.000
Remove your hand from the box and you die.

01:33.000 --> 01:37.000
Does Emma have choice to not?

01:37.000 --> 01:42.000
An animal caught in a trap will gnaw off its own leg to escape.

01:42.000 --> 01:44.000
What will you do?

01:44.000 --> 01:50.000
I would set it free and give it kisses and a bandage.

01:50.000 --> 01:52.000
Silence.

01:52.000 --> 01:54.000
Oh!

01:54.000 --> 01:55.000
Oh!

01:55.000 --> 01:57.000
Neil, I wonder what to do.

01:57.000 --> 02:00.000
Neil!

02:00.000 --> 02:02.000
Neil!

02:02.000 --> 02:04.000
Neil like it.

02:04.000 --> 02:06.000
Neil like it.

02:06.000 --> 02:08.000
Neil like it.

02:08.000 --> 02:10.000
Neil like it.

02:10.000 --> 02:13.000
I'll never give up.

02:23.000 --> 02:25.000
I wonder what to do.

02:27.000 --> 02:29.000
Neil.

02:29.000 --> 02:39.000
Neil.

